2026-10-23T10:11:43.7541596Z       --socket <SOCKET>    Root-owned local helper socket [default: /run/rustusb/control.sock]
2026-10-23T10:11:43.7542200Z       --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Discovery timeout covering DNS, connect and response [default: 10]
